   "id": "s4_t",
   "x": 86.39999999999998,
   "y": 282.5,
   "width": 1027.2,
   "height": 60.0,
   "text": "Both junctions: TSD = the reference between them (1 to 50 bp). Poly(A) tail = pure run at the inserted end.\nWithout clip junctions (mates only): the breakpoint is tried as left and as right junction; the side kept\nhas a poly(A/T) tail or an inserted sequence of the right family. An assembled junction drops IMPRECISE.",
   "originalText": "Both junctions: TSD = the reference between them (1 to 50 bp). Poly(A) tail = pure run at the inserted end.\nWithout clip junctions (mates only): the breakpoint is tried as left and as right junction; the side kept\nhas a poly(A/T) tail or an inserted sequence of the right family. An assembled junction drops IMPRECISE.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
